{
  "apiVersion": 1,
  "id": "research-dashboard",
  "name": "Research Dashboard",
  "version": "0.2.0",
  "minNakamaVersion": "0.4.10",
  "author": "self-hosted deployment",
  "license": "MIT",
  "description": "Shared research coordination state — topics, development axes and the evidence attached to them — as a dashboard page plus five agent tools.",
  "actions": [
    {
      "key": "get_overview",
      "access": "member",
      "effect": "read",
      "entry": "actions/actions.js",
      "exposeAsTool": true,
      "description": "Dashboard summary — all three views in one call. Counts by state, then one entry per topic with its people, the state counts of its development axes, the axes themselves in attention order (blocked → active → usable → draft → parked → completed → abandoned) with their repository/branch/PR line, current state and blocker, and how much activity each topic saw in the window. Also every blocked axis with its topic and blocker text, the most recently touched topics and recent activity. `people` is the person-first view (one row per person — never one per link — with the topics and axes they are on grouped underneath, plus the activity attributable to their own account and when their work was last recorded and last reviewed); `repositories` is the repository-first view (the topics each codebase supports, the axes that name it, the events recorded against it or its axes). Attribution is narrow on purpose: an event belongs to a person only when its actor maps to their account, and a person with no account mapped reports attributable=false — say that rather than reporting them as idle. Nothing here is scored, ranked or turned into a workload percentage. Start here for 'what is going on' questions, then call get_topic for the one topic that matters.",
      "inputSchema": {
        "type": "object",
        "additionalProperties": false,
        "properties": {
          "activitySinceDays": {
            "type": "integer",
            "minimum": 0,
            "maximum": 365
          },
          "includeArchived": {
            "type": "boolean"
          },
          "limit": {
            "type": "integer",
            "minimum": 1,
            "maximum": 50
          }
        },
        "required": []
      }
    },
    {
      "key": "get_topic",
      "access": "member",
      "effect": "read",
      "entry": "actions/actions.js",
      "exposeAsTool": true,
      "description": "Everything recorded about one topic (by topicId or topicName): its fields, every development axis with full metadata (kind, branch, PR, state, current state, blocker, per-claim confidence, people, repositories), each axis's own evidence — the branch, PR, activities and notes that could back its claims, the same set the write rule accepts — its own history and its own notes, plus the topic's people, repositories, activity log and notes. `annotations` is the topic-level note list (`notes` is the same list; a note belonging to an axis is under that axis's `notes`). Read the version it returns if you intend to write the topic back.",
      "inputSchema": {
        "type": "object",
        "additionalProperties": false,
        "properties": {
          "topicId": {
            "type": "string",
            "minLength": 1,
            "maxLength": 100
          },
          "topicName": {
            "type": "string",
            "minLength": 1,
            "maxLength": 120
          },
          "activityLimit": {
            "type": "integer",
            "minimum": 1,
            "maximum": 100
          },
          "activitySinceDays": {
            "type": "integer",
            "minimum": 1,
            "maximum": 365
          },
          "historyLimit": {
            "type": "integer",
            "minimum": 1,
            "maximum": 100
          },
          "notesLimit": {
            "type": "integer",
            "minimum": 1,
            "maximum": 100
          },
          "includeAnnotations": {
            "type": "boolean"
          }
        },
        "required": []
      }
    },
    {
      "key": "search_dashboard",
      "access": "member",
      "effect": "read",
      "entry": "actions/actions.js",
      "exposeAsTool": true,
      "description": "Find the row a conversation is about: substring search over topic names, descriptions and summaries, axis titles, states, blockers and branches, activity summaries and references, and annotation text. Each hit reports which field matched. Search before you create anything, so you extend the existing topic instead of near-duplicating it.",
      "inputSchema": {
        "type": "object",
        "additionalProperties": false,
        "properties": {
          "query": {
            "type": "string",
            "minLength": 1,
            "maxLength": 200
          },
          "limit": {
            "type": "integer",
            "minimum": 1,
            "maximum": 50
          },
          "includeArchived": {
            "type": "boolean"
          }
        },
        "required": ["query"]
      }
    },
    {
      "key": "reconcile_topic",
      "access": "member",
      "effect": "write",
      "entry": "actions/actions.js",
      "exposeAsTool": true,
      "description": "The single write path for a topic update. Applies topic fields, axes (created or updated by id or title), repository and person links, activity and annotations in ONE transaction: either all of it lands or none of it does. Send only what the conversation established. Pass expectedVersion (from get_topic) to fail with a conflict instead of overwriting a change someone else made. Any claim you mark 'confirmed' must be backed by evidence in the same call — an activity, an annotation, a branch or a PR; without evidence, label it 'inferred'. Axis state names are active, usable, draft, blocked, parked, completed and abandoned; usable (not completed) is the state for work that is operationally relevant and still has acknowledged gaps. Problems are raised and updated through problems[], plans and their steps through plans[], and state changes through transitions[]; a problem's state is accepted only when creating it, because changing an existing state is a recorded transition, not a field update. A refusal returns {ok:false, kind}: conflict means re-read and retry, no-op means it is already in that state so do not retry, invalid-state means that state name does not exist, human-authored means an agent may not rewrite text a human wrote (ask the person instead), and invalid-input is every other fixable-rule refusal.",
      "inputSchema": {
        "type": "object",
        "additionalProperties": false,
        "properties": {
          "topicId": {
            "type": "string",
            "minLength": 1,
            "maxLength": 100
          },
          "topicName": {
            "type": "string",
            "minLength": 1,
            "maxLength": 120
          },
          "expectedVersion": {
            "type": "integer",
            "minimum": 1
          },
          "topic": {
            "type": "object",
            "additionalProperties": false,
            "properties": {
              "name": {
                "type": "string",
                "minLength": 1,
                "maxLength": 120
              },
              "description": {
                "type": "string",
                "maxLength": 4000
              },
              "status": {
                "type": "string",
                "enum": ["active", "paused", "completed", "archived"]
              },
              "summary": {
                "type": "string",
                "maxLength": 4000
              }
            },
            "required": []
          },
          "repositories": {
            "type": "array",
            "maxItems": 20,
            "items": {
              "type": "object",
              "additionalProperties": false,
              "properties": {
                "fullName": {
                  "type": "string",
                  "minLength": 1,
                  "maxLength": 200
                },
                "url": {
                  "type": "string",
                  "maxLength": 500
                },
                "description": {
                  "type": "string",
                  "maxLength": 1000
                },
                "defaultBranch": {
                  "type": "string",
                  "maxLength": 120
                },
                "relationship": {
                  "type": "string",
                  "enum": ["primary", "supporting"]
                }
              },
              "required": ["fullName"]
            }
          },
          "people": {
            "type": "array",
            "maxItems": 20,
            "items": {
              "type": "object",
              "additionalProperties": false,
              "properties": {
                "displayName": {
                  "type": "string",
                  "minLength": 1,
                  "maxLength": 120
                },
                "role": {
                  "type": "string",
                  "maxLength": 80
                },
                "githubLogin": {
                  "type": "string",
                  "maxLength": 100
                },
                "nakamaUserId": {
                  "type": "string",
                  "minLength": 1,
                  "maxLength": 100
                }
              },
              "required": ["displayName"]
            }
          },
          "axes": {
            "type": "array",
            "maxItems": 20,
            "items": {
              "type": "object",
              "additionalProperties": false,
              "properties": {
                "id": {
                  "type": "string",
                  "minLength": 1,
                  "maxLength": 100
                },
                "title": {
                  "type": "string",
                  "minLength": 1,
                  "maxLength": 160
                },
                "description": {
                  "type": "string",
                  "maxLength": 2000
                },
                "kind": {
                  "type": "string",
                  "enum": [
                    "feature",
                    "experiment",
                    "test",
                    "investigation",
                    "maintenance"
                  ]
                },
                "state": {
                  "type": "string",
                  "enum": [
                    "active",
                    "usable",
                    "draft",
                    "blocked",
                    "parked",
                    "completed",
                    "abandoned"
                  ]
                },
                "branch": {
                  "type": "string",
                  "maxLength": 200
                },
                "prNumber": {
                  "type": "integer",
                  "minimum": 1
                },
                "prUrl": {
                  "type": "string",
                  "maxLength": 500
                },
                "currentState": {
                  "type": "string",
                  "maxLength": 2000
                },
                "blocker": {
                  "type": "string",
                  "maxLength": 1000
                },
                "stateConfidence": {
                  "type": "string",
                  "enum": ["confirmed", "inferred", "uncertain"]
                },
                "currentStateConfidence": {
                  "type": "string",
                  "enum": ["confirmed", "inferred", "uncertain"]
                },
                "blockerConfidence": {
                  "type": "string",
                  "enum": ["confirmed", "inferred", "uncertain"]
                },
                "expectedVersion": {
                  "type": "integer",
                  "minimum": 1
                },
                "repositories": {
                  "type": "array",
                  "maxItems": 10,
                  "items": {
                    "type": "object",
                    "additionalProperties": false,
                    "properties": {
                      "fullName": {
                        "type": "string",
                        "minLength": 1,
                        "maxLength": 200
                      },
                      "url": {
                        "type": "string",
                        "maxLength": 500
                      },
                      "description": {
                        "type": "string",
                        "maxLength": 1000
                      },
                      "defaultBranch": {
                        "type": "string",
                        "maxLength": 120
                      },
                      "relationship": {
                        "type": "string",
                        "enum": ["primary", "supporting"]
                      }
                    },
                    "required": ["fullName"]
                  }
                },
                "people": {
                  "type": "array",
                  "maxItems": 10,
                  "items": {
                    "type": "object",
                    "additionalProperties": false,
                    "properties": {
                      "displayName": {
                        "type": "string",
                        "minLength": 1,
                        "maxLength": 120
                      },
                      "role": {
                        "type": "string",
                        "maxLength": 80
                      },
                      "githubLogin": {
                        "type": "string",
                        "maxLength": 100
                      },
                      "nakamaUserId": {
                        "type": "string",
                        "minLength": 1,
                        "maxLength": 100
                      }
                    },
                    "required": ["displayName"]
                  }
                }
              },
              "required": []
            }
          },
          "activities": {
            "type": "array",
            "maxItems": 50,
            "items": {
              "type": "object",
              "additionalProperties": false,
              "properties": {
                "summary": {
                  "type": "string",
                  "minLength": 1,
                  "maxLength": 1000
                },
                "sourceType": {
                  "type": "string",
                  "enum": [
                    "manual",
                    "github_pr",
                    "github_commit",
                    "github_issue",
                    "repo_document",
                    "group_chat",
                    "experiment",
                    "agent_review"
                  ]
                },
                "sourceRef": {
                  "type": "string",
                  "maxLength": 200
                },
                "sourceUrl": {
                  "type": "string",
                  "maxLength": 500
                },
                "occurredAt": {
                  "type": "string",
                  "maxLength": 40
                },
                "axisId": {
                  "type": "string",
                  "minLength": 1,
                  "maxLength": 100
                },
                "axisTitle": {
                  "type": "string",
                  "minLength": 1,
                  "maxLength": 160
                },
                "repositoryFullName": {
                  "type": "string",
                  "minLength": 1,
                  "maxLength": 200
                },
                "problemId": {
                  "type": "string",
                  "minLength": 1,
                  "maxLength": 100
                }
              },
              "required": ["summary"]
            }
          },
          "annotations": {
            "type": "array",
            "maxItems": 20,
            "items": {
              "type": "object",
              "additionalProperties": false,
              "properties": {
                "text": {
                  "type": "string",
                  "minLength": 1,
                  "maxLength": 2000
                },
                "axisId": {
                  "type": "string",
                  "minLength": 1,
                  "maxLength": 100
                },
                "axisTitle": {
                  "type": "string",
                  "minLength": 1,
                  "maxLength": 160
                },
                "kind": {
                  "type": "string",
                  "enum": ["note", "interpretation", "steering"]
                },
                "confidence": {
                  "type": "string",
                  "enum": ["confirmed", "inferred", "uncertain"]
                },
                "problemId": {
                  "type": "string",
                  "minLength": 1,
                  "maxLength": 100
                }
              },
              "required": ["text"]
            }
          },
          "problems": {
            "type": "array",
            "maxItems": 25,
            "items": {
              "type": "object",
              "additionalProperties": false,
              "properties": {
                "problemId": {
                  "type": "string",
                  "minLength": 1,
                  "maxLength": 100
                },
                "statement": {
                  "type": "string",
                  "minLength": 1,
                  "maxLength": 2000
                },
                "axisId": {
                  "type": "string",
                  "minLength": 1,
                  "maxLength": 100
                },
                "axisTitle": {
                  "type": "string",
                  "minLength": 1,
                  "maxLength": 160
                },
                "state": {
                  "type": "string",
                  "enum": ["open", "resolved"]
                },
                "stateConfidence": {
                  "type": "string",
                  "enum": ["confirmed", "inferred", "uncertain"]
                },
                "planStepId": {
                  "type": ["string", "null"],
                  "maxLength": 100
                },
                "repositoryFullNames": {
                  "type": "array",
                  "maxItems": 20,
                  "items": {
                    "type": "string",
                    "minLength": 1,
                    "maxLength": 200
                  }
                },
                "personIds": {
                  "type": "array",
                  "maxItems": 50,
                  "items": {
                    "type": "string",
                    "minLength": 1,
                    "maxLength": 100
                  }
                }
              },
              "required": ["statement"]
            }
          },
          "plans": {
            "type": "array",
            "maxItems": 10,
            "items": {
              "type": "object",
